---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import MaterialField from './MaterialField.astro';
---
<section class="work-chapter" data-project="caldiy" aria-labelledby="caldiy-title">
  <article class="project-stage caldiy-project">
    <div class="project-copy">
      <h2 id="caldiy-title" class="chapter-title" style="view-transition-name: project-caldiy"><a href="/work/caldiy">Cal.diy</a></h2>
      <p class="project-type">QA strategy and automation</p>
      <h3>One slot.<br />Twenty contenders.</h3>
      <p>I tested a self-hosted scheduling system across APIs, time zones, concurrent bookings, and accessibility. The target is Cal.diy v6.2.0; documented failures stay in the evidence.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/work/caldiy">Inspect Cal.diy <Icon /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-visual">
      <MaterialField shape="caldiy" />
      <figure class="contention-figure">
        <div class="contention-bars" aria-hidden="true">{Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => <span class:list={{ winner: i === 0 }}></span>)}</div>
        <figcaption><strong>1 persisted booking</strong><span>19 expected conflicts in a recorded contention run</span></figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
<section class="work-chapter" data-project="llm" aria-labelledby="llm-title">
  <article class="project-stage llm-project">
    <div class="project-copy">
      <h2 id="llm-title" class="chapter-title" style="view-transition-name: project-llm-evaluation"><a href="/work/llm-evaluation">LLM Evaluation<br />Harness</a></h2>
      <p class="project-type">AI quality assurance</p>
      <h3>How reliable<br />is the judge?</h3>
      <p>I built a testing harness for a local retrieval-augmented question-answering system. It evaluates retrieval, answers, and safety, then checks the refusal judge against human labels.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/work/llm-evaluation">Read the evaluation <Icon /></a>
    </div>
    <div class="project-visual">
      <MaterialField shape="llm-evaluation" />
      <figure class="judge-figure">
        <div class="agreement"><span>82<span class="percent">%</span></span><p>raw agreement with<br />45 blind human labels</p></div>
        <div class="agreement-track" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
        <figcaption>The refusal judge remains outside CI gates.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>
<section class="archive-link" aria-label="Framework archive">
  <h2 class="chapter-title">Six frameworks.<br />Four testing disciplines.</h2>
  <div class="archive-link-action"><p>Web · API · Mobile · Performance</p><a class="text-link" href="/work">Explore the work archive <Icon /></a></div>
</section>
<style>
  .work-chapter { position: relative; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .work-chapter.has-chapter-motion { min-height: 170svh; }
  .has-chapter-motion .project-stage { position: sticky; top: 0; }
  .project-stage { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6%; align-items: center; min-height: 100svh; padding: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem) var(--page-gutter); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.2vw, 6rem); line-height: 1.03; }
  .project-type { margin-top: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-amber); font-size: 1rem; }
  h3 { margin-top: 2.3rem; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3.2rem); }
  .project-copy > p:last-of-type { max-width: 46ch; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #d5cec4; }
  .text-link { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .project-visual { min-width: 0; }
  .project-visual :global(.material-field) { max-height: 44svh; }
  figure { min-width: 0; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; }
  .contention-bars { display: flex; align-items: end; gap: clamp(3px, .55vw, 9px); height: clamp(5rem, 10svh, 8rem); }
  .contention-bars span { flex: 1; height: 40%; background: #756c60; transform-origin: bottom; }
  .contention-bars .winner { height: 100%; background: var(--color-amber); }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  figcaption span, .judge-figure figcaption { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .agreement { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: end; }
  .agreement > span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1; color: var(--color-amber); }
  .percent { font-size: .45em; }
  .agreement p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--color-muted); padding-bottom: .6rem; }
  .agreement-track { height: 2px; background: var(--line); margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .agreement-track span { display: block; width: 82%; height: 100%; background: var(--color-amber); transform-origin: left; }
  .judge-figure figcaption { color: var(--color-muted); }
  .archive-link { padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem) var(--page-gutter); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; gap: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .archive-link h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 4.4rem); }
  .archive-link-action { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .archive-link-action p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .9rem; }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .project-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; min-height: auto; padding-block: 4rem; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, calc(1rem + 5.7vw), 4.5rem); }
    .project-copy > p:last-of-type { font-size: 1rem; }
    .project-visual { width: 100%; max-width: 40rem; margin-inline: auto; }
    .project-visual :global(.material-field) { max-height: none; }
    .contention-bars { height: 6rem; }
    .agreement > span { font-size: clamp(5rem, 19vw, 8rem); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .archive-link { flex-direction: column; align-items: start; gap: 2rem; }
    .archive-link-action { flex-shrink: 1; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    h3 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, calc(1rem + 3vw), 1.8rem); }
    .archive-link h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, calc(1rem + 4vw), 2rem); }
  }
</style>
